素，周围萦绕着优雅红色缎带。画面两旁设立复古麦克风，暗示人物身份为歌手或表演者。几只充满跃动感的金鱼围绕人物四周，增添活力与童话气息。\n\n光影氛围细腻，用暖色调铺陈画面，柔和的橙黄光线将主体人物温暖笼罩。背景的光线呈现渐层效果，由亮到暗过渡流畅，突显画面空间感。整体色彩以暖色为主，金色、红色、深蓝色相辅相成，带有高饱和度形成视觉冲击力。\n\n构图景别采用居中安排，以人物为视觉中心，背景设计繁复但秩序井然，前景与背景的层次分明，展现细腻与艺术感。画面风格整体兼具浪漫与梦幻氛围，饱满情感与丰富细节突出眼前场景的唯美感与故事张力。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 334, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 209, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "patched_model", "links": [292], "label": "patched_model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "patched_model"}], "size": [210, 82], "pos": [-1075.493408203125, 1798.323486328125], "widgets_values": [1, false], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 312, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength"}, "name": "strength", "label": "strength", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "strength"}, {"widget": {"name": "pre_cfg"}, "shape": 7, "name": "pre_cfg", "label": "pre_cfg", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "pre_cfg"}], "flags": {}, "id": 194, "type": "CFGNorm", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.4.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.2.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "CFGNorm", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [293], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["cute anime style girl with massive fluffy fennec ears and a big fluffy tail blonde messy long hair b